    <meta property="og:title" content="Physics-informed machine learning - Nature Reviews Physics"/>
    <meta property="og:description" content="The rapidly developing field of physics-informed learning integrates data and mathematical models seamlessly, enabling accurate inference of realistic and high-dimensional multiphysics problems. This Review discusses the methodology and provides diverse examples and an outlook for further developments."/>
